{
  "id": "RzRuzMVi64lHyHwy",
  "name": "Claim Checks | Ask Venice",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "av-title",
      "name": "Title Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "# Claim Checks | Ask Venice\n\nAsks Venice ONE model question for another Claim Checks step and returns the answer as `output` (the parsed JSON when the step sends a schema). If the main model gives no complete answer, the same question goes to a backup model, so one slow or offline model does not stop a run.\n\n**Called by:** \"WF3 — Research Pipeline\", \"Verify Story\", \"Collect Findings\", \"Follow Up Story\", \"Story Chat\" (every model step except the two web searches and the Story Chat agent). Locked to them.\n**Alerts:** no error workflow on purpose: a failure goes back to the calling step, so the caller's own alert names the step (and Collect/Verify failures stay in the run's ONE problem alert).\nstructure-ok: no error workflow on purpose, so a failure is reported once, by the caller.\n**Services called:** Venice (main model from the step, e.g. Kimi K2.6 or GLM-5.3 Flash; backup GPT-6 Luna)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "av-sec",
      "name": "Ask With Backup Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 1400,
        "height": 680,
        "content": "## Ask With Backup\n\nTriggered by: a calling step (When Called By Step), with the step name and the full Venice request.\n\nWhat it does, step by step:\n1. Store Settings holds the backup model (GPT-6 Luna).\n2. Ask Main Model (Venice): the request as sent, 60 s limit, 3 tries.\n3. Main Answer Complete? checks it finished and, for a schema step, is valid JSON. No → Ask Backup Model (Venice): the same request on GPT-6 Luna, 60 s, 3 tries.\n4. Read Answer returns `output` and `model_used`; it fails with the step name if neither model answered."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "av-trig",
      "name": "When Called By Step",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        300,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "step"
            },
            {
              "name": "body",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "av-set",
      "name": "Store Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        520,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "av-s1",
              "name": "backup_model",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "openai-gpt-6-luna"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "av-main",
      "name": "Ask Main Model (Venice)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "position": [
        740,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.venice.ai/api/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "openAiApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "venice api"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "av-if",
      "name": "Main Answer Complete?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "av-c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ (() => { const c = ($json.choices || [])[0] || {}; const text = c.message && c.message.content; if (c.finish_reason !== 'stop' || !text) return false; if (!$('Store Settings').item.json.body.response_format) return true; try { JSON.parse(text); return true; } catch (e) { return false; } })() }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "av-backup",
      "name": "Ask Backup Model (Venice)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "onError": "stopWorkflow",
      "position": [
        1180,
        840
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.venice.ai/api/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "openAiApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify((() => { const s = $('Store Settings').item.json; const b = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(s.body)); b.model = s.backup_model; delete b.temperature; if (b.venice_parameters) { delete b.venice_parameters.disable_thinking; } b.reasoning_effort = 'low'; b.max_tokens = (b.max_tokens || 2000) + 2000; return b; })()) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "venice api"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "av-read",
      "name": "Read Answer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1400,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "av-r1",
              "name": "output",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ (() => { const s = $('Store Settings').item.json; const c = ($json.choices || [])[0] || {}; const text = c.message && c.message.content; if (c.finish_reason !== 'stop' || !text) throw new Error('No complete answer from the main or the backup model for ' + s.step + ': ' + (c.finish_reason || ($json.error && $json.error.message) || 'no answer')); return s.body.response_format ? JSON.parse(text) : { text: text }; })() }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "av-r2",
              "name": "model_used",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.model || '' }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When Called By Step": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Store Settings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Store Settings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Ask Main Model (Venice)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Ask Main Model (Venice)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Main Answer Complete?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Main Answer Complete?": {
      "main": [
